## Arranged before you go out

Reception arranges bike hire, tram tickets, museum entry and canal cruises. Ask at the desk rather than queueing for any of it.

Amsterdam is flat, close together and built for the bike. From the front door the canal ring is north, the Amstel east and the Vondelpark west, and none of them is far.
